<title>UK: Smithkline Beecham Q1 pretax profits up 8pct.</title>
<headline>Smithkline Beecham Q1 pretax profits up 8pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter to March 31.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  10.2		 vs     9.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	    4.41		vs	na</p>
<p> Pretax			418.00		vs   387.00</p>
<p> Turnover		  1,838.00		vs 1,874.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 420 and 430 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Smithkline Beecham Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
